      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13504.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13500.0,
      "text": "人家還支持他 因為知道咱沒有任何事情"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.187304,
      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13507.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13504.0,
      "text": "就像相信他的父親當年沒有事一樣"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.187304,
      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13512.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13509.0,
      "text": "兄弟姐妹們 有兩樣事情紅線絕不可越過"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.187304,
      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13516.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13513.0,
      "text": "一個是法律的紅線 任何人過了"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.187304,
      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13519.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13516.0,
      "text": "新中國聯邦幫不了你 也不會幫你"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.187304,
      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13524.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13520.0,
      "text": "第二 就是我們的追求共同民滅共的紅線"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.187304,
      "compression_ratio": 1.372,
      "end": 13527.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13524.0,
      "text": "你不滅共 這個紅線跨過去了 那誰也不會幫你"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.247769,
      "compression_ratio": 1.295567,
      "end": 13532.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13527.0,
      "text": "只要這兩條你能守住 真滅共遵守法律紅線"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.247769,
      "compression_ratio": 1.295567,
      "end": 13534.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13532.0,
      "text": "沒有咱過不去的考量"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.247769,
      "compression_ratio": 1.295567,
      "end": 13538.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13535.0,
      "text": "我不相信世界上還有比我們再幸福的"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.247769,
      "compression_ratio": 1.295567,
      "end": 13546.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13543.0,
      "text": "菲菲睡著了 你看什麼 菲菲睡著了"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.247769,
      "compression_ratio": 1.295567,
      "end": 13550.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13547.0,
      "text": "沒有 阿平 你也不管管這"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.247769,
      "compression_ratio": 1.295567,
      "end": 13554.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13551.0,
      "text": "都睡著了 大哥兒還睡著 哎呀 大哥兒沒睡著"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13558.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13554.0,
      "text": "所以說兄弟姐妹們 我們今天在這裏說這種歡聚"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13562.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13559.0,
      "text": "真的是 我們今天就是迎來有戰友的親娘"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13566.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13563.0,
      "text": "親娘來了 是吧 我們的羅伊家家的娘在這"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13568.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13566.0,
      "text": "還有戰友的你看 長島哥夫人"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13572.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13569.0,
      "text": "島夫人來了就開始 啥時候就怪島夫人"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13575.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13573.0,
      "text": "島夫人來了 還有我們今天"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13578.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13576.0,
      "text": "真的是 特別你看我們這個"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.250416,
      "compression_ratio": 1.550847,
      "end": 13582.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13579.0,
      "text": "咱們大家看到 這是多少神奇的戰友"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.235526,
      "compression_ratio": 1.32287,
      "end": 13587.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13582.0,
      "text": "大家看小九窩啊 小九窩要沒有新中國兩毛"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.235526,
      "compression_ratio": 1.32287,
      "end": 13589.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13587.0,
      "text": "我相信今天他絕對不會活到現在"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.235526,
      "compression_ratio": 1.32287,
      "end": 13594.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13591.0,
      "text": "我們的文子醫生今天就在後面 文子醫生救了多少人"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.235526,
      "compression_ratio": 1.32287,
      "end": 13597.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13594.0,
      "text": "Alex醫生今天沒到 Alex醫生要到的話"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.235526,
      "compression_ratio": 1.32287,
      "end": 13598.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13597.0,
      "text": "大家你們想想什麼情況 是吧"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.235526,
      "compression_ratio": 1.32287,
      "end": 13603.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13599.0,
      "text": "這些人沒有一分錢的圖毛 救了多少人"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.138614,
      "compression_ratio": 1.300448,
      "end": 13608.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13603.0,
      "text": "就過去兩周最起碼一兩百個從國內跑出來的戰友的家庭"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.138614,
      "compression_ratio": 1.300448,
      "end": 13612.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13609.0,
      "text": "每個人都說七哥 感謝你讓我們沒打苗"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.138614,
      "compression_ratio": 1.300448,
      "end": 13615.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13613.0,
      "text": "感謝你讓我們都吃了藥"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.138614,
      "compression_ratio": 1.300448,
      "end": 13618.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13617.0,
      "text": "沒有多少人說感謝怎麼著"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.138614,
      "compression_ratio": 1.300448,
      "end": 13621.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13619.0,
      "text": "然後說七哥讓我們活著出來"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.138614,
      "compression_ratio": 1.300448,
      "end": 13625.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13622.0,
      "text": "發生無數個傳奇的故事 大家都是很多農場主都知道的"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.277249,
      "compression_ratio": 1.327273,
      "end": 13628.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13625.0,
      "text": "小李昨天就在我們說的小李的那種時候又跑出來一個"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.277249,
      "compression_ratio": 1.327273,
      "end": 13631.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13629.0,
      "text": "今天早上又跑出三甲 是吧"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.277249,
      "compression_ratio": 1.327273,
      "end": 13634.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13632.0,
      "text": "然後你看那邊大額捐款的咱們每個的戰友"
    },
    {
      "avg_logprob": -0.277249,
      "compression_ratio": 1.327273,
      "end": 13638.0,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.0,
      "start": 13635.0,
